<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: Landwhale arrival -->
  <DNX_HostileLandwhaleArrival.label>陆鲸抵达</DNX_HostileLandwhaleArrival.label>
  <!-- EN: Landwhale arrival -->
  <DNX_HostileLandwhaleArrival.letterLabel>陆鲸抵达</DNX_HostileLandwhaleArrival.letterLabel>
  <!-- EN: An old corporate armed vehicle, an HFSV-40 Landwhale ground-effect fire support vehicle, has appeared near the colony edge. This is not a normal raid target: the Landwhale carries a main cannon, auxiliary weapons, and an onboard point-defense system. Its weapons are mounted as independent modules and can be destroyed separately. If you destroy the main cannon first, the Landwhale's threat will drop sharply. Its point-defense system will try to intercept heavy shells, rockets, and other decisive munitions before they connect. Use cheap, low-quality explosive rounds or other expendable fire to saturate the interceptors, then send in your heavy shots while the defense is distracted or reloading. -->
  <DNX_HostileLandwhaleArrival.letterText>一辆旧式企业武装载具出现在殖民地边缘附近：HFSV-40“陆鲸”地效火力支援车。这不是普通袭击目标：陆鲸搭载主炮、辅助武器和车载点防御系统。它的武器以独立模块安装，可以被单独摧毁。如果优先击毁主炮，陆鲸的威胁会大幅降低。它的点防御系统会尝试在命中前拦截重型炮弹、火箭和其他关键弹药。使用廉价、低质量的爆炸弹药或其他可消耗火力来饱和拦截器，然后趁点防御分心或装填时打入你的重型弹药。</DNX_HostileLandwhaleArrival.letterText>
  
  <!-- EN: Hunt the Landwhale -->
  <DNX_LandwhaleHuntOfferIncident.label>猎杀陆鲸</DNX_LandwhaleHuntOfferIncident.label>
  
  <!-- EN: mechanoid reconnaissance -->
  <DNX_MechanoidDroneSwarm.label>机械族侦察</DNX_MechanoidDroneSwarm.label>
  <!-- EN: Mechanoid reconnaissance -->
  <DNX_MechanoidDroneSwarm.letterLabel>机械族侦察</DNX_MechanoidDroneSwarm.letterLabel>
  <!-- EN: A squad of mechanoid mantas has arrived above the colony. They will track and attack colonists and turrets. Be careful: they can fly over defenses and walls! -->
  <DNX_MechanoidDroneSwarm.letterText>一队机械族蝠鲼抵达了殖民地上空。它们会追踪并攻击殖民者和炮塔。小心：它们可以飞越防线和墙体！</DNX_MechanoidDroneSwarm.letterText>
  
</LanguageData>
